 a variety of actions like sword attacks, dodging, and parrying to defeat diverse bosses. Dive into mysterious painted worlds with charming pixel art characters.","steam_appid":4007970,"support_info":{"email":"mazurkadevofficial@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Korean","type":"demo","website":null}